  "children": [],
  "designMd": {
    "raw": "# HamunaAgent — Visual Layer\n\nModern-minimal, warm paper twist. Productivity tool with an editorial, tactile warmth — not cold, not sterile, not \"yet another white SaaS\".\n\n## Genre\nWarm-paper editorial. Terracotta accents on a cream paper base; no aggressive saturation.\n\n## Palette (synced to `Mode` axis)\n\n| Layer | Token | Light | Dark | Role |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Paper | `$color-bg-deep` | `#faf6ee` | `#1a1614` | Base surface |\n| Paper-elevated | `$color-surface` | `#fffcf7` | `#242018` | Cards, modals |\n| Paper-inset | `$color-surface-2` | `#e8dccf` | `#12100e` | Inputs, code blocks |\n| Paper-mid | `$color-surface-3` | `#f0e9dc` | `#3a342c` | Pressed, nested |\n| Ink | `$color-text-primary` | `#1c1612` | `#e4dcd4` | Primary text |\n| Ink-secondary | `$color-text-body` | `#2e2825` | `#cfc5ba` | Body text |\n| Ink-muted | `$color-text-muted` | `#6f6156` | `#968a7e` | Secondary |\n| Ink-subtle | `$color-text-subtle` | `#a69a90` | `#685c52` | Tertiary |\n| Accent (warm) | `$color-accent` | `#c26d3a` | `#d4803f` | Terracotta — CTAs, active, focus |\n| Accent-hover | `$color-accent-warm-hover` | `#e18a58` | `#e89860` | Primary action hover |\n| Accent (cool) | `$color-accent-cool` | `#2e6f5e` | `#4aad8a` | Teal — secondary, success |\n| Success | `$color-success` | `#2d8a5e` | `#4aad7a` | Positive state |\n| Error | `$color-destructive` | `#dc2626` | `#ef4444` | Destructive |\n| Warning | `$color-warning` | `#d97706` | `#f59e0b` | Caution |\n| Info | `$color-info` | `#4a7ab5` | `#6b9fd4` | Informational |\n| Line | `$color-border` | `#1c16121a` | `#e4dcd41a` | Dividers |\n| Line-strong | `$color-border-strong` | `#1c16122e` | `#e4dcd42e` | Strong borders |\n\n## Typography\n- Display: SF Pro Display / PingFang SC, 700 weight, `line-height: 1.1`\n- Body: SF Pro Text / PingFang SC, 400 weight, `line-height: 1.6`\n- Mono: SF Mono / Cascadia Code / Consolas\n- Scale: 12 / 14 / 16 / 18 / 20 / 22 / 28 / 56 (brand)\n\n## Radii\n`$radius-base` 4 · `$radius-sm` 6 · `$radius-md` 10 · `$radius-lg` 14 · `$radius-xl` 18 · `$radius-2xl` 22 · `$radius-full` 9999\n\n## Spacing\n`$section-gap` 32 · `$section-gap-lg` 48 · `$card-gap` 16 · `$card-padding` 20\n\n## Motion\n`$duration-fast` 150ms · `$duration-normal` 200ms · `$duration-slow` 300ms — CSS transitions only.\n\n## Accent discipline\nTerracotta occupies ≤ 3% of any viewport. Use it for: active nav, focus rings, primary CTA border/text, small decorative marks. Do not fill large buttons.\n\n## Page archetypes\n- **Launcher**: Marquee Hero — full-width brand + tagline + CTA, asymmetric content grid below\n- **Chat**: Workbench — minimal top bar, full-height thread, grounded input strip\n- **Settings / TaskCenter / Space**: Workbench — sidebar + grouped sections, staggered cards\n- **Nav**: N9 (edge-aligned minimal)\n",
    "projectName": "HamunaAgent — Visual Layer",
    "colorPalette": [
      {
        "name": "| Paper | `$color-bg-deep` | `",
        "hex": "#FAF6EE",
        "role": "` | `#1a1614` | Base surface |"
      },
      {
        "name": "| Paper-elevated | `$color-surface` | `",
        "hex": "#FFFCF7",
        "role": "` | `#242018` | Cards, modals |"
      },
      {
